      "title": "Tapered mixing energy",
      "description": "Flocculation needs gentle mixing for 15–30 min. Energy is highest in the first stage (G ≈ 50–70 s⁻¹) to promote collisions and lowest in the last (G ≈ 10–20 s⁻¹) so the large, fragile flocs are not broken up before settling. The product G·t (≈ 10⁴–10⁵) is a key design number.",
